   "id": "seg-01",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "Before we merge, the automatic checks must pass. I ask one question about the terminal. Leo tells me a story about the command line. Maria explains the status check to me. I learn about the required check because it is useful. I need to make an appointment before lunch. I write a short note about the reschedule the meeting. The team gives me good advice.",
   "tts": "Before we merge, the automatic checks must pass. I ask one question about the terminal. Leo tells me a story about the command line. Maria explains the status check to me. I learn about the required check because it is useful. I need to make an appointment before lunch. I write a short note about the reschedule the meeting. The team gives me good advice.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-01.mp3",
   "zh": "合并之前，自动检查必须通过。我问了一个关于终端的问题。Leo 给我讲了一个关于命令行的小故事。Maria 给我讲解状态检查。我学习必需检查，因为它很有用。午饭前，我需要进行预约。我给重新安排会议时间写了一条简短的笔记。团队给了我很好的建议。",
   "hard": [
