  {
   "id": "seg-02",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "I reschedule a short meeting, because the time does not work. Leo shows me how to cancel an appointment. I confirm the time one small step at a time. Maria explains the shell to me. I learn about the command prompt because it is useful. Now I understand the pending check. I write a short note about the passing check. The day is busy, but I learn a lot.",
   "tts": "I reschedule a short meeting, because the time does not work. Leo shows me how to cancel an appointment. I confirm the time one small step at a time. Maria explains the shell to me. I learn about the command prompt because it is useful. Now I understand the pending check. I write a short note about the passing check. The day is busy, but I learn a lot.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-02.mp3",
   "zh": "我重新安排了一个短会，因为那个时间不方便。Leo 教我怎样取消预约。我一步一步地确认时间。Maria 给我讲解命令解释器。我学习命令提示符，因为它很有用。现在我理解了等待中的检查。我给通过的检查写了一条简短的笔记。这天很忙，但我学到了很多。",
