   "id": "seg-03",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "Before I leave, I finish one last task. I ask one question about the failed check. I check details one small step at a time. Maria explains the current directory to me. I learn about the command option because it is useful. During our chat, Maria says, \"Does Tuesday work?\" I answer, \"I'm not available then.\" All checks are green. We merge tomorrow.",
   "tts": "Before I leave, I finish one last task. I ask one question about the failed check. I check details one small step at a time. Maria explains the current directory to me. I learn about the command option because it is useful. During our chat, Maria says, \"Does Tuesday work?\" I answer, \"I'm not available then.\" All checks are green. We merge tomorrow.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-03.mp3",
   "zh": "离开前，我完成最后一项任务。我问了一个关于失败的检查的问题。我一步一步地检查详情。Maria 给我讲解当前目录。我学习命令选项，因为它很有用。聊天时，Maria说：\"星期二方便吗？\"我回答：\"我那时没有空。\"所有检查都是绿色的。我们明天合并。",
